  "notes": [
    "See REGISTERS.txt for ordering and command semantics.",
    "Client counters observe L2 entrances after SBUS arbitration; two bank stalls may occur per cycle.",
    "Directory hits/misses include coherence and replay.",
    "Snapshot 100/300 MHz epochs are associated by handshake; edges are not simultaneous.",
    "AXI flight tracking persists through CLEAR and disabled measurement.",
    "R occupied bus bytes includes unused lanes for narrow reads.",
    "Frozen DATA is zero while busy or invalid; split 32-bit reads are stable between snapshot/clear/reset.",
    "Idle S02 has only enabled cycles and timestamp.",
    "ABI1.2 appends banks2/3 as blocks14/15, client bank requests as slots14/15; completed D messages remain slot13.",
    "Four-bank geometry: 1 MiB, mask0x3000, sets A6:A11 and A14:A16, 128 KiB bank/set period.",
    "Two-bank fallback remains ABI1.1 with 14 blocks, mask0x1000 and 512 KiB.",
    "L2 slot19 preserves bank0-and-bank1 D-fire; slots20..22 count wider simultaneous returns.",
    "Per-cycle client stalls are summed bank-cycles and may reach four; they are not wall-clock delay."
  ]
